<title>FINLAND: LANNEN TEHTAAT BOND ISSUE FULLY SUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>LANNEN TEHTAAT BOND ISSUE FULLY SUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish foodstuffs group Lannen Tehtaat Oy said its 100 million markka issue of five-year bullet bonds carrying a 6.00 percent coupon had been oversubscribed and subscription was halted.</p>
<p>&quot;Application will be made for listing the bonds on the Helsinki Stock Exchange,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
